Package: bluelineR
Title: Tidy Access to the NHL's Web, Stats, EDGE and Goal-Tracking APIs, IIHF Data and NHL Odds
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ethan", "Rawson", , "ethanb.rawson@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Wraps the public endpoints behind NHL.com: schedules, scores,
    standings, play-by-play, box scores and shift charts; players, rosters,
    stat leaders and the draft; the stats and records APIs; NHL EDGE skating,
    shot and zone-time tracking; and the puck and player tracking frames
    behind every goal since 2023-24. Also the IIHF's live data (every shot of
    its tournaments placed on the ice) and DraftKings' NHL odds and player
    props as ESPN publishes them. Results come back as tibbles with
    snake_case names and rink coordinates in feet, with helpers that read how
    a goal was scored from its tracking and draw it on a rink.
